      "created_at": "2019-02-21T13:55:16Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-02-25T10:28:50Z",
      "body": "The cookies set for this are `ckns_privacy` `ckns_explicit`.\r\nThey both start off with the value of `0`\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11341355/53173653-038c8d00-35e0-11e9-90f8-f28ea2937d29.png)\r\n`ckns_privacy` is set to 1 whenever you see this banner. Once you have shown it on a page, it is set to 1 and never shown again.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11341355/53173671-0d15f500-35e0-11e9-89be-19678c4e1ace.png)\r\n`ckns_explicit` is set to `1` whenever you select \"Yes, I agree\" or \"No, take me to settings\". You HAVE to select an option for this cookie to be changed from `0` to `1`\r\n\r\n\r\nUPDATE: \r\nYou need to also set the `ckns_policy` cookie to either '111' or '000' depending on if they click 'Yes' or 'No' on the cookie banner (no the privacy update one). BUT if `ckns_policy` is already set, dont update it.\r\n\r\nIf we dont set `ckns_policy` when we set `ckns_privacy` and `ckns_explicit`, when the user visits an orbit page `ckns_policy` will default to `000` which means disable all non functional cookies.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
