      "updated_at": "2019-02-21T13:57:10Z",
      "body": "The current orbit implementation only shows the banner if you are in the UK or the EU. This is done via Fig which isnt something we wish to use atall if possible. If we were to replicate the cookie banner we would likely wish to show it to everyone, even those outside the EU. \r\n\r\n@jimjohnsonrollings any chance you can look into if this would be an issue please?",
