      "updated_at": "2019-02-22T10:34:28Z",
      "body": "Ok so ive made https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/pull/1336 as a POC of the nonorbit canonical cookie banner\r\n\r\nI _think_ it does everything we need. It doesnt do alot of the orbit cookie handling stuff, (like when you disable the personalisation setting, delete personalisation cookies, but that should be ok for v1 as we dont use them, so when the user goes to an orbit page to use them, they will be removed.\r\n\r\nWe also would need to swap the cookie banner wording for one inc adverts on .com\r\n\r\nCurious what people think about its complexity in https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/blob/56b6a8d4c7d90297c6191c217a21f5856acbc3c9/src/app/containers/CookieBanner/index.jsx\r\nThis has been done following their stories https://github.com/bbc/nav-orbit/blob/master/test/cucumber/features/stories/021-gdpr/banner-cookie-prompt.feature#L47\r\n\r\nJim has confirmed we dont need in/out EU treatment so I ignored that (edited) ",
